			"notes": "- Fixed a server freeze when using `/locate` with `generateStructures` set to `false`.\n- Master Mode: After a monster has taken no damage for 10 seconds, it regenerates 5% of its maximum health every 3 seconds, restoring up to 75% of the health it has lost. Added a configurable entity blacklist for this regeneration mechanic.\n- Fixed music discs stopping prematurely and further compressed their audio files.\n- add backward dodge\n- Add mana and maximum mana commands, individual skill learn/forget commands and filtered completion; learn all now uses each skill's maximum level."
		},
