			"notes": "Remove the Secret Room that is too hard to find, replaced with more conspicuous but fewer fairy pool and fairy root.\n\nWhen a fairy upgrade the tool or weapon, the fairy will disappear. The fairy pool & root will refresh in 7 game days when the fairies are all gone.\n\nEnhance the speed of Keese.\n\nChange the movement logic of Navi and fairy.\n\nAdd English doc for Navi's communication.\n\nEnhance the flash assault so that players can march toward the back of target.\n\nAdd skills beyond control to those with invincibility, like dodge, dash attack, etc.\n\nRemove the requirement of lock of spin attack.\n\nNow the sword beam add to combo.\n\nChange the icon of goddess harp.\n\nImprove the reward of Cursed Man.\n\nAdd tab auto completion of /zss skill set.\n\nSet durability to weapon apart from different kinds of master sword and some tools."
		},
